ers":[8]}],"link":"59698","synopsis":"Doubles teams are reassigned when a new member joins the badminton team, and former singles player Saeki Sota is assigned to play doubles with his brother Toya. Toya is excited to play doubles with his brother, but Sota's feelings on the change are complicated, and a fight between the two threatens to dissolve their doubles team entirely. Meanwhile, Toya finds himself in a bind at work, too...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lukp82Xy31qA4RUOwQpaG9A6Vz7.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Doubles teams are reassigned when a new member joins the badminton team, and former singles player Saeki Sota is assigned to play doubles with his brother Toya. Toya is excited to play doubles with his brother, but Sota's feelings on the change are complicated, and a fight between the two threatens to dissolve their doubles team entirely. Meanwhile, Toya finds himself in a bind at work, too...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/lukp82Xy31qA4RUOwQpaG9A6Vz7.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16920","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"140502","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50185","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"136841","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"411665","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[9]}],"link":"59946","synopsis":"Mikoto is confused when Tatsuru suddenly announces he wants to dissolve their doubles team. Tatsuru leaves on a business trip and meets up with his former partner Izumo Naohiro in Kyoto. Meanwhile, Mikoto coincidentally discovers Tatsuru's situation and runs into the world's number one ranked singles player, Ibuki Sentaro of Mitsuhoshi Bank. He becomes distressed when his true feelings are identified. What conclusions will Mikoto and Tatsuru arrive at...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AsKRXaLVkIrCY2C5TYlZun5Yj4Z.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 9","synopsis":"Mikoto is confused when Tatsuru suddenly announces he wants to dissolve their doubles team. Tatsuru leaves on a business trip and meets up with his former partner Izumo Naohiro in Kyoto. Meanwhile, Mikoto coincidentally discovers Tatsuru's situation and runs into the world's number one ranked singles player, Ibuki Sentaro of Mitsuhoshi Bank. He becomes distressed when his true feelings are identified. What conclusions will Mikoto and Tatsuru arrive at...?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AsKRXaLVkIrCY2C5TYlZun5Yj4Z.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 10","episodeNumber":10,"sourceEpisodeNumber":10,"seasonNumber":1,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"16920","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"140502","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"mal","id":"50185","episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"136841","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"411665","scope":"s1","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumbers":[10]}],"link":"60129","synopsis":"The ultimate corporate tournament known as the S/J League begins. Sunlight Beverage makes it into the top four, but for some reason Tatsuru hasn't shown up to their semifinal match. The scheming of an executive director who does not take kindly to the badminton club gets Tatsuru called into a board meeting where he is in danger of being fired. Tatsuru does everything he can to fight back. Meanwhile, Sota and Toya battle fiercely against Kirishima and Oginome of Unisics...","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5HUsKQLnFWQV5UqyF9auMrnNPqs.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"The ultimate corporate tournament known as the S/J League begins. Sunlight Beverage makes it into the top